      "author_observation": {
        "source_id": "SRC-DTH-TOK-01",
        "paraphrase": "Sennrich and colleagues describe a character-based subword representation, repeatedly count adjacent symbol pairs and merge a frequent pair, and exclude pairs that cross word boundaries. Chapter 42 uses a separate course raw-byte policy; its numeric token IDs, tie order and document framing are not claims about the paper.",
        "rights_observation": "The paper displays a 2016 Association for Computational Linguistics copyright notice. No redistribution grant was observed in the retrieved paper. Full PDF and full extracted text remain ignored run evidence only.",
